  "text": "Unfortunately this place is not a public library. Do yourself a favor and bypass here. I came here last minute. The lady at the front desk wouldn’t even print anything for me. All I needed was about 4 pages of prints. She stated only Georgia Tech Students and Staff. I mean so rude , at least she could have printed the pages. Then, told me next time it’s only for Georgia Tech. It’s very misleading because it says Publix. Very nasty, distasteful and rude. Please just don’t go out your way to stop here.",
